{"3478990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NecroMerc", "steam_appid": 3478990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It's Ironic how much you hate robots considering you're at least 70% necrobots by now. Every time one of us brings you back you get a little less human.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as X a mercenary whose job is being replaced by robots and is reskilling into necromancy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X has watched the job postings dwindle as mercenary's are replaced by androids. After death number 74 while working as a bodyguard for a necromancer (one of the few people left to hire human bodyguards) X decided to start learning a new career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NecroMerc is a twist on the classic FPS genre with RPG necromancy mechanics. You might be shooting enemies while also summoning skeletons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a futuristic setting where you play on different planets as well as on space stations. The environments are a mix of sci-fi, cyberpunk, and horror. You get to choose missions and travel to different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree lets you choose between improving your shooting and several different branches of necromancy.  You could specialize in summoning, poisons, or necrohacking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It's Ironic how much you hate robots considering you're at least 70% necrobots by now. Every time one of us brings you back you get a little less human.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as X a mercenary whose job is being replaced by robots and is reskilling into necromancy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X has watched the job postings dwindle as mercenary's are replaced by androids. After death number 74 while working as a bodyguard for a necromancer (one of the few people left to hire human bodyguards) X decided to start learning a new career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NecroMerc is a twist on the classic FPS genre with RPG necromancy mechanics. You might be shooting enemies while also summoning skeletons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a futuristic setting where you play on different planets as well as on space stations. The environments are a mix of sci-fi, cyberpunk, and horror. You get to choose missions and travel to different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree lets you choose between improving your shooting and several different branches of necromancy.  You could specialize in summoning, poisons, or necrohacking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Play as X a mercenary whose job is being replaced by robots and is reskilling into necromancy. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478990/header.jpg?t=1786390479", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478990/fddfa45ae5ab9644d89e2c327ba534f5b533e496/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786390479", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478990/fddfa45ae5ab9644d89e2c327ba534f5b533e496/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786390479", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developer